  "body": "Perched at Silverdale’s highest point, this near-new 5-bedroom, 3-bathroom and double garages residence combines modern elegance, space, and stunning sunset views.\r\n\r\nFeaturing soaring 3.5m ceilings, a light-filled open-plan layout, premium Bosch appliances, and quality finishes throughout, this home is designed for effortless living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nHighlights include:\r\n• 4 spacious upstairs bedrooms plus a versatile ground-floor guest/master suite\r\n• Stylish family lounge and luxurious master ensuite\r\n• Designer kitchen with large island and high-spec appliances\r\n• Central air-conditioning, smart entry, and elegant LED features\r\n• Covered outdoor entertaining area with beautiful outlooks\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned close to schools, shops, motorway access, transport, beaches, Snowplanet, and Gulf Harbour Golf.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a modern masterpiece in one of Silverdale’s most sought-after locations. Call today to arrange your private viewing .",
